  "scenario":"Build a paste service that stores a value under a key and returns it on reads. The datastore begins with 128 seeded values. Traffic is 75% reads, with most requests targeting a small hot set. An API-only diagram cannot return correct values: requests must reach a datastore, or a cache that was filled by it. Meet correctness and latency goals within the budget.",
